<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner Q1 profit per division.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner Q1 profit per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results per division at Anglo-Norwegian construction and engineering group Kvaerner ASA for the three months to March 31.</p>
<p>				 (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>OPERATING PROFIT</p>
<p> Shipbuilding		    290	  vs	 313</p>
<p> Process			    20	  vs	  -</p>
