<p> Process			    60	  vs	  -</p>
<p> Construction	    minus  21	  vs	  -</p>
<p> Oil &amp; gas			  67	  vs	  69</p>
<p> Metals			     54	  vs	  -</p>
<p> Pulping		   minus  26	  vs  minus 37</p>
<p> Other businesses	minus 166	  vs	 222</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
